2026-08-02T11:53:58.0641033Z          "refs": "HEAD -> main, origin/main, origin/HEAD",
2026-08-02T11:53:58.0645288Z          "body": "CRITICAL FIX: Moved the global disable rule from the base config template\ninto the Python merge script, ensuring it's added FIRST, followed by the\nspecific enable rules.\n\nIn Renovate, the last matching rule wins. The order is now:\n1. Global disable: matchPackagePatterns=['*'] + matchManagers=['gomod','npm'] + enabled=false\n2. Specific enables: matchPackageNames=['lodash'] + matchManagers=['npm'] + enabled=true\n\nSince the specific rules come AFTER and are more specific (exact package\nname vs pattern), they should override the global disable.\n\nThis should finally allow Go/npm package upgrade PRs to be created.\n",
2026-08-02T11:53:58.0649432Z          "author_name": "Ajay Nair",
2026-08-02T11:53:58.0649888Z          "author_email": "anair@ddn.com"
2026-08-02T11:53:58.0650317Z        }
